Markdown

# 🏢 UNIQUE INFOTECH / BANKURA ZILLA YOUTH COMPUTER TRAINING CENTRE
## Centre Management System (CMS) — Master Execution Plan

---

### 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
- **Project Name:** Unique Infotech CMS (`unique-infotech-cms`)
- **Type:** Internal Management System (Private management app, no public registration)
- **Head Office:** Unique Infotech, Kenduadihi, Bankura, West Bengal
- **Primary Operation:** Bankura Zilla Youth Computer Training Centre (Govt. of West Bengal project, Directorate of Youth Services, running since 2006)
- **School Operation:** Unique Kids Computer Program (Single campus school)

---

### 2. ORGANISATION STRUCTURE & USER HIERARCHY
SUPER ADMIN (1 account: Email + Password)
│
├── YOUTH COMPUTER CENTRE
│ ├── Branch A (1 Branch Head: Google Sign-in)
│ ├── Branch B (1 Branch Head: Google Sign-in)
│ └── (Unlimited branches dynamically created by Super Admin)
│
└── SCHOOL COMPUTER PROGRAM
└── Unique Kids (1 School Head: Google Sign-in)
└── Levels: Basic / Advance / Level 3 (Dynamic names & prices)

text


**Key Business Rules:**
1. Head Office (Unique Infotech) is management-only (no teaching branch).
2. Franchise model is completely excluded.
3. Strict 1 Email = 1 Branch limit (no multi-branch dropdowns). Changing email revokes old access immediately.
4. Top navigation includes a switcher: `[ Youth Computer Centre ▼ ]` / `[ School Computer Program ]`.

---

### 3. YOUTH COMPUTER CENTRE — ACADEMIC & FEE MODEL

#### A. Course & Package Structure
- **Base Courses (Sem 1):** 6-month courses (CITA, CFAS, CDTP, CDTA, etc.) set dynamically by Super Admin.
- **Packages:**
  - Diploma = Sem 1 + Sem 2
  - Advanced = Sem 1 + Sem 2 + Sem 3 (18 months)
- **Rules:** No direct Sem 2/3 admission. Students start at Sem 1 and upgrade step-by-step. Sem 2 requires completed Sem 1. Sem 3 requires completed Sem 1 + 2.

#### B. Upgrade & Continuation Logic
- **Sem 1:** Fresh student record created.
- **Sem 2 Upgrade:** System searches existing student record.
  - *If found:* Auto-fills details, carries forward payment history, tags as "Completed Sem 1".
  - *If NOT found (Archived/Deleted):* Allows manual entry + asks for past Sem 1 session details + tags as "Completed Sem 1".
- **Sem 3 Upgrade:** Searches Sem 2 records and carries forward all history.

#### C. Youth Fees & Fines
- **Admission Fee:** Collected once at admission.
- **Installments:** Fixed full installment amounts (NO partial payments allowed).
- **Examination Fee:** Collected per semester/course end (set by Super Admin, editable/waivable by Branch Head).
- **Study Material:** Flexible addition at admission, with any installment, or separately (Type + Title + Price).
- **Fine Rule:** Paid after 10th of the month = ₹1/day fine. Branch Head can waive/reduce fine (waivers are recorded in reports).
- **Late Joiners:** Full fee applies; passed due dates automatically generate Due + Fine.

---

### 4. SCHOOL COMPUTER PROGRAM — UNIQUE KIDS

- **Scope:** 1 School only ("Unique Kids").
- **Levels:** 3 levels (Basic, Advance, Level 3) with dynamic pricing set by Super Admin.
- **Fee Model:** One-time Admission Fee + Monthly Fee + Optional Study Material (Type + Title + Price).
- **Fine Rule:** Paid after 10th = ₹1/day. School Head can waive (recorded in reports).
- **School Head:** Has identical operational powers as a Youth Branch Head, scoped strictly to Unique Kids.

---

### 5. STUDENT RECORDS & DOCUMENTS

- **Student ID:** Pending client decision (Auto / Manual / Hybrid).
- **Compulsory Data:** Name, Photo, Signature, DOB, Gender, Phone, Address, Guardian Name & Phone, Admission Date, Branch/School, Current Status.
- **Document Uploads:**
  1. Birth Certificate / Aadhaar / Madhyamik Admit
  2. Higher Qualification Marksheet
  3. Passport Photo
  4. Signature
- **Storage Rules:** Images compressed in browser (~150-200 KB) before Firebase Storage upload.

---

### 6. RECEIPTS & PRINTING
- **3 Print/PDF Options:** Student Copy | Office Copy | Merged Copy (side-by-side).
- **Format:** Text-based downloadable PDF.
- **Header:** Full organisation details, logo, and "In Collaboration With Unique Infotech".
- **Tracking:** Includes "Collected By" (Branch/School Head name) on every transaction.

---

### 7. SECURITY & ACCESS CONTROL
- **Authentication:** Firebase Auth (Email/Password for Super Admin, Google Sign-in for Heads).
- **Data Isolation:** Enforced at database level via Firestore Security Rules (`branchId` matching). Branch Heads cannot read/write other branch data even via direct browser manipulation.
- **Inactivity Protection:** Auto-logout after 30–45 minutes idle time.
- **Delete Protection:** Re-enter Super Admin password + consent checkbox + confirmation popups before batch deletion.

---

### 8. ARCHIVE SYSTEM
- Batch completion -> Generate Archive -> Download ZIP (contains `index.html` offline viewer, `students.json`, `payments.json`, and actual compressed photo/document files).
- Deletion from Firebase live database is **optional** and controlled by Super Admin after ZIP verification.

---

### 9. TECH STACK & TOOLS
- **Frontend:** Plain Vanilla HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+). NO React/Vue/Angular/npm.
- **Styling:** Custom CSS + Lucide Icons (NO Emojis allowed). Custom animated dropdowns with icons.
- **Libraries (CDN):** SweetAlert2 (Popups), html2pdf.js (PDF Receipts), SheetJS (Excel Exports), Chart.js (Dashboard Analytics).
- **Backend:** Firebase Hosting, Firestore, Firebase Storage, Firebase Auth, Cloud Functions (Blaze Plan configured strictly within $0.00 free limits).
- **Budget Protection:** Google Cloud Budget Alert set at $0.01 (1 cent).
