CMS stands for Content Management System (or in our case, Centre Management System).

In plain English: It is just a standard software short-name for an application that helps you manage all the daily information of an organisation (students, branches, fees, courses, payments) through a simple screen without touching complex code or databases.

You can name your folder anything you like!
For example:

unique-infotech-system
bzyctc-app
unique-infotech-cms
Pick whichever name you prefer!




