The utility folder will include validator.js and date-utils.js. HTML pages may sit flat in public/ for easier copy-paste with Firebase Hosting. The final structure will balance deep categorization with simple file discovery.

The final structure places all application HTML pages inside a dedicated pages/ folder. The root will contain Firebase configuration files: firebase.json, firestore.rules, storage.rules, and .firebaserc.

