Super Admin can set a default Examination Fee amount while creating/editing a Course (or Package semester).
On the student fee screen / Pay Fees screen, when the time comes (or anytime), Branch Head can collect Examination Fee as a separate charge.
It appears as its own line on the receipt (e.g. “Examination Fee – Sem 1”).
It is recorded in payment history and reports (so owner can see exam fee collection separately if needed).
Branch Head can still use the same “Collect Payment” flow — no extra complicated page.
