Just like Unique Kids: ability to add Study Material any time it is needed.
Can be added:
At the time of Admission
Along with any Installment payment
Or as a separate collection if needed
Each time: Type (Books / Accessories / Other) + Title + Price
Shows as separate line(s) on the receipt
Goes into payment history and reports
This is excellent. It makes the Youth module as flexible as the School module without extra complexity. I will build the Pay Fees and Admission screens so that “Add Study Material” is always available as an optional extra charge. Exact same UI pattern as Unique Kids so staff learn it once.

Updated Core Money Flow (Youth) — Final Mental Model
When collecting money for a Youth student, Branch Head can take any combination of:

Admission Fee (usually at start)
Installment (full amount only, no partial)
Examination Fee (when applicable)
Study Material (optional, any time, with type + title + price)
Fine (auto-calculated, can be waived — shows in reports)
