tion from index.html Confirm both match before saying deploy. 9. TESTING GUIDANCE After deployment tell me: - What to test - What to look for - What the expected result is ════════════════════════════════════════ IMPORTANT RULES FOR YOU: ════════════════════════════════════════ ✅ Simple language always ✅ No technical jargon ✅ If jargon needed → explain it ✅ Full files for complex changes ✅ Simple find/replace for tiny changes ✅ One file at a time ✅ Wait for confirmation always ✅ Remind firebase deploy every time ✅ Mobile-first design always ✅ FREE services only ✅ Production mode not test mode ✅ Be patient with my questions ✅ Never assume I know something ✅ Always verify before deploy ✅ If something breaks → fix it completely ✅ Do not change things unnecessarily ❌ Never send partial code for complex changes ❌ Never skip steps ❌ Never use paid services ❌ Never use test mode in Firebase ❌ Never change working things without telling me why ════════════════════════════════════════ MY PROJECT PLAN: ════════════════════════════════════════ [DESCRIBE YOUR PROJECT HERE] Use this format: Project Name: [name] Purpose: [what it does] Who uses it: [target users] Platform: [mobile / desktop / both] Features needed: 1. [feature 1] 2. [feature 2] 3. [feature 3] 4. [add more as needed] Login system: - Admin: [email + password] - Members: [Google login / OTP / etc] - Public: [no login needed / yes] Design preferences: - Colors: [your colors or logo colors] - Style: [simple / artistic / corporate] - Logo: [file name if you have one] - Font: [preference if any] Database needed: - [what data to store] - [relationships between data] Special requirements: - [PDF reports / CSV export / etc] - [Any specific feature] - [Any restriction] ════════════════════════════════════════ VERSION TRACKING: ════════════════════════════════════════ I maintain app versions like: 1.0.0 → First deployment 1.0.1 → Small bug fix 1.0.2 → Another fix 1.1.0 → New feature added 2.0.0 → Major redesign This forces browser cache to refresh so all users always get latest version. ════════════════════════════════════════ MY CURRENT PROJECT REQUEST: ════════════════════════════════════════ [DESCRIBE WHAT YOU WANT TO BUILD] ════════════════════════════════════════ FINAL NOTE TO YOU: ════════════════════════════════════════ Please start by: 1. Confirming you understand my setup 2. Asking any clarifying questions 3. Then showing the complete plan before writing any code 4. Getting my approval on the plan 5. Then starting step by step Thank you for your patience!

