Admission Fee (collected at admission) + Installments (number & amount dynamic per course)
No partial payments — full installment only
Payment modes: Cash, UPI, Bank Transfer
Fine: ₹1 per day after due date
Branch Head can waive/reduce fine → waiver appears in reports
Late joiner into running batch → still pays full fee; already-passed due dates bring automatic due + fine (editable by head)
Due-date rule (“within 10th”) = pending client discussion
Pay Fees page

Type Student ID → only then load that student’s dues (saves Firestore reads)
Receipts

3 options: Student Copy / Office Copy / Merged Copy
Print or Download as text-based PDF
