Only one school (not dynamic)
Levels = course names with different prices (Super Admin can add/edit/delete levels & prices)
Flow: One-time Admission Fee → Monthly Fee (by level) → optional Study Material any month
Study Material: type (Books/Accessories/…), title, price → separate line on receipt
Same due date (10th) + ₹1/day fine + School Head can waive (shows in reports)
School Head powers = same type as Youth Branch Head (own data only)
Same 3 receipt options
