🎯 Part 3 is Locked In! And You Fixed a MAJOR Bug!
Your logic for the Archive/Deleted Student Upgrade is absolutely brilliant. You solved a huge real-world problem: What happens if the student comes back for Sem 2, but their Sem 1 data was already ZIP archived and deleted from Firebase?

